    .CollateralAuctionHouseParams({
        minimumBid: 100 * WAD, // 100 HAI
        minDiscount: 1e18, // no discount
        maxDiscount: 0.6e18, // -40%
        perSecondDiscountUpdateRate: 999_976_350_945_209_694_432_911_116 // -40% / 6hs
});

// Encoded Params:
0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000056bc75e2d631000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000de0b6b3a76400000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000853a0d2313c00000000000000000000000000000000000000000000033b293a9b400e846ea5df0c
```

**3.** Initialize the new collateral in the [SAFE (Vault) Engine](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/address/0x9Ff826860689483181C5FAc9628fd2F70275A700) \[*Executable Code Function 3*]

```
