// Encoded Params:
0x0000000000000000000000001d2b53cde55bc4a90f14cf6d94ecd810d694575200000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000010a741a462780000000000000000000000000022361d8afcc93343e962029a7edab2000000000000

liquidationEngine.initializeCollateralType(VELO, abi.encode(_liquidationEngineCParams[VELO]));
```

**6.** Initialize the new collateral in the [Tax Collector](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/address/0x62B82ccE08f8F2D808348409E9418c65EB1973C3) \[*Executable Code Function 6*]

