2. [Hardcoded Oracle (HAI)](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/address/0x8c212bCaE328669c8b045D467CB78b88e0BE0D39) -`0x8c212bCaE328669c8b045D467CB78b88e0BE0D39`
3. [Denominated Oracle (HAI)](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/address/0x5a1b8327f3b7584b999628398cdcf9844311a836) -`0x5a1b8327f3b7584b999628398cdcf9844311a836`
4. [PID Controller](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/address/0x6f9aeC3c0DF4DF7A0Da66453a38B8C767972f609) -`0x6f9aeC3c0DF4DF7A0Da66453a38B8C767972f609`

